(7631980, 1237068, 104230, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition with both strong vertical and horizontal elements and a pleasing palette, and "Waldo" is well camouflaged!</td>', 'Interesting composition with both strong vertical and horizontal elements and a pleasing palette, and "Waldo" is well camouflaged!', '2019-06-05 00:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7631982, 1237183, 104230, '<td valign="top">An interesting image to explore. The rail lines and train carriages provide a strong visual element for the eye to follow.  Although it''s unfortunate that the road on the left leads one out of the image.<br/>Well done having only one person so visible. Makes me wonder what time of day this was taken, or did you remove others?</td>', 'An interesting image to explore. The rail lines and train carriages provide a strong visual element for the eye to follow.  Although it''s unfortunate that the road on the left leads one out of the image.Well done having only one person so visible. Makes me wonder what time of day this was taken, or did you remove others?', '2019-06-05 00:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7631983, 1237170, 104230, '<td valign="top">I like the almost abstract feel to this image. Well seen.</td>', 'I like the almost abstract feel to this image. Well seen.', '2019-06-05 00:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
